===================
 dbt7-post-process
===================

---------------
Database Test 7
---------------

:Date: @MANDATE@
:Manual section: 1
:Manual group: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@ Documentation
:Version: Database Test 7 @PROJECT_VERSION@

SYNOPSIS
========

**dbt7-post-process** [option...]

DESCRIPTION
===========

**dbt7-post-process** is the Database Test 7 (DBT-7) post processing
script.  It aggregates the test execution and query times from a results
directory into a *summary.rst* file, and calculates the *Queries per Hour*
score when all of the tests were run.  It is normally invoked by
**dbt7-run**\ (1).

OPTIONS
=======

-i DIRECTORY  DBT-7 results *directory*.
-o PATH  Output directory.
--help  This usage message.  Or **-?**.

SEE ALSO
========

**dbt7**\ (1), **dbt7-run**\ (1), **dbt7-report**\ (1)
